# 318 -> 313 (previous): the start of chapter 6, and the divergences it found.
#
# §15.24 does not move this number -- it was already COVERED -- and that is the point. The
# ledger was LYING, which is worse than an UNCOVERED row, because an UNCOVERED row is a
# standing invitation to look and a false COVERED row closes the question. sema.c computed the
