# The fix is not "reject protected access": all four permitted forms were checked to still
# compile and run -- this.x, super.x, the simple name, and a subclass-typed qualifier -- and
# the reject case carries delta3d alongside delta so a compiler that banned the lot would fail
# the positive half rather than pass the negative one.
